{"title":"Meet New People, Great Conversations & 50+ Board Games | 25–45 | Fast Friends ","startsAt":"2026-10-17T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-17T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Ever wish there were an easier way to turn a room full of strangers into people you actually want to talk to?\n*That’s what Fast Friends is designed for.*\n\nInstead of arriving at a busy pub and wondering who to approach, our host guides you through short conversations and rotations, giving you the chance to meet a variety of people throughout the evening. You get a little structure to make connecting easier — without making the evening feel forced or formal.\n\nAnd once the hosted rounds finish, you can keep the evening going. 🎲\nWe’re back at Stout Irish Pub in Cabbagetown — a relaxed Irish pub with food, drinks and 50+ board games, giving you plenty of ways to continue socialising with the people you’ve met.\n\n🎟️ Book Early & Save: [https://toronto17thoct.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto17thoct.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door: CAD $20 cash — to host Faye\nBooking ahead helps us plan the right group size and venue space, and your ticket confirms your place.\n\n🤝 What to Expect\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host, Faye, grab a drink and settle in.\nComing alone? Completely fine. Many guests arrive solo, and we’ll help you get comfortable and connected from the start.\n7:30 PM — Fast Friends\nThis is where the evening gets going.\nYou’ll move through a series of short, guided conversations, meeting different people along the way. Our host keeps the rotations moving, so you don’t have to worry about who to approach or what to do next.\nJust show up, join the conversation and see who you click with.\n\n✨ Themed Connection Rounds\nThroughout the evening, we’ll mix in themed rounds and interactive prompts designed to make connecting easier.\nThey’ll help you discover shared interests, experiences and unexpected things you have in common — taking the conversation beyond the usual small talk.\n\n🎲 8:30 PM onwards — Board Games & Socialising\nOnce the hosted rounds finish, the evening doesn’t have to.\nStout has 50+ board games available, making it easy to keep the conversations going. Pick a game with the people you’ve met, grab another drink, join a group or simply continue chatting.\nYou don’t have to be a serious gamer — the games are simply another easy way to socialise and get to know people.\n\n🍻 Staying Later?\nStout’s current After Dark Special runs from 9–11 PM, with $7 beers and $7 highballs, among other specials.\n\n❤️ Why Come Along?\n✔️ Meet 15–25 new people in one evening\n✔️ Guided conversations make meeting people easier\n✔️ Meet different people through rotating conversations\n✔️ Interactive themed rounds to spark better conversations\n✔️ 50+ board games available afterwards 🎲\n✔️ Relaxed Irish pub atmosphere\n✔️ Reserved space for our group\n✔️ Most guests come solo\n✔️ Plenty of time to keep socialising after the hosted rounds\n✔️ Friendship-focused — not a dating event\n\n👋 Who Is It For?\nAges 25–45\nWhether you’ve just moved to Toronto, have lived here for years, or simply feel like your social circle could use some fresh faces, you’re welcome.\nYou don’t need to know anyone beforehand or arrive with a group.\nCome by yourself, bring a friend, or simply come ready to have a few good conversations and see where the evening takes you.\n\n🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years, Fast Friends has been bringing people together through professionally hosted social events in 30+ cities worldwide.\nOur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier, more relaxed and more enjoyable.\nCome for the conversations. Stay for the games. Leave with new connections. ❤️","venue":{"name":"Stout Irish pub","address":"221 Carlton St., Toronto, ON M5A 2L2, Canada,, Toronto","lat":43.663795,"lng":-79.368904,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Singles in the city (13000+)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/2/4/1/highres_536245153.jpeg"}